summary = "Towering mercenaries from the Mountains of Mourn, more often hired than fought. IMPORTANT CAVEAT: Ogres are Size Large in the source material (Archives of the Empire), which changes Wounds, damage, and how other creatures' attacks/Fear work against them — this project doesn't model Size yet, so an Ogre character here is mechanically just a very strong, tough Human-sized character. Treat as a placeholder until Size is implemented, not a rules-accurate Ogre."
